iptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"open_issues":3,"closed_issues":2535,"state":"closed","created_at":"2025-11-27T20:29:18Z","updated_at":"2026-10-20T18:39:31Z","due_on":null,"closed_at":"2026-06-19T16:54:35Z"},"comments":1,"created_at":"2026-03-11T00:55:53Z","updated_at":"2026-04-10T15:39:49Z","closed_at":"2026-04-10T15:38:30Z","assignee":{"login":"BastiaanOlij","id":1945449,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5NDU0NDk=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1945449?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/BastiaanOlij","html_url":"https://github.com/BastiaanOlij","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BastiaanOlij/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BastiaanOlij/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BastiaanOlij/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BastiaanOlij/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BastiaanOlij/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BastiaanOlij/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BastiaanOlij/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BastiaanOlij/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BastiaanOlij/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"### Tested versions\n\n- Reproducible in 4.0.3-stable\n- Reproducible in 4.1.3-stable\n- Reproducible in 4.4.1-stable\n- Reproducible in 4.6.1-stable\n- Reproducible in master (a1eaac8171a53e5a74cd511bc144bd28afc4c7ff)\n\nVery likely been broken for a long time but I do believe this worked at some point in time as I worked on this in 4.0/4.1 days. Ran into it by accident while testing something else.\n\n**edit** looks like that even when I fixed some issues around SDFGI back in the day, this one has been around since the start. \n\n### System information\n\nWindows 11 - NVidia 4080 - Godot 4.6\n\n### Issue description\n\nWhen asymmetrical projection matrices are used, SDFGI is visually wrongly applied. It looks like a screenspace issue, not unprojecting properly, but to my knowledge SDFGI works in world space. Been looking at the code trying to fix it but so far just scratching my head.\n\nI'm using Hugo's [Godot reflection demo](https://github.com/Calinou/godot-reflection) here but with just SDFGI turned on:\n<img width=\"557\" height=\"855\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/316a99ab-2641-485f-9449-441a77b90197\" />\n\nChanging the camera to Frustum mode and setting the size to 0.1 things look as they should:\n<img width=\"1920\" height=\"1112\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/d32adac8-b8ae-42c0-a504-9a4d1fbe207c\" />\n\nNow as we change our frustum offset, watch what happens to the bottom of the center column, at frustum offset (0.0, 0.01):\n<img width=\"1920\" height=\"1112\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/7a33b989-3b5a-4dda-9bac-3848e9ce1b7e\" />\n\nAt frustum offset (0.0, 0.02):\n<img width=\"1920\" height=\"1112\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/2636a0de-75f3-4369-b1ec-e2c95969ffa6\" />\n\nSimilar issues happen when skewing left/right with the x component of the offset, just in this test scene it stands out better when adjusting the y.\n\nPutting the images side by side it look like it's just sampling the wrong probes, but like I said, I don't think SDFGI does anything in screens space.\n\n### Steps to reproduce\n\nEasiest to reproduce with Hugos test scene. Just:\n- turn off other effects to isolate SDFGI\n- change the camera to a frustum camera\n- turn camera preview on\n- play around with the camera position and frustum offset and see what happens\n\n### Minimal reproduction project (MRP)\n\nhttps://github.com/Calinou/godot-reflection","closed_by":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo","html_url":"https://github.com/Repiteo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/117303/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/117303/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":"completed","pinned_comment":null}